@startuml cicd-workflow
!pragma activityFlow
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam arrowColor #333333
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title CI/CD Workflow Overview - GitHub Actions (explore-workspace)

|#palegreen|**Workflow: ci.yml**|
start
note right
**Trigger:** push to main | pull_request
**Scope:** projects affected by the change (ai-server, ai-web, ...)
end note
:**CI**
(nx affected -t lint test build
 ai-server: spotless + checkstyle + test via Gradle
 ai-web: lint → test → build);
stop

|#lightblue|**Workflow: ai-ios.yml**|
start
note right
**Trigger:** changes under ai/ios
end note
:**iOS**
(xcodebuild test on the simulator);
stop

|#wheat|**Workflow: ai-image.yml**|
start
note right
**Trigger:** changes under ai/server or the root Gradle build
end note
:**Image**
(docker build -f ai/server/Dockerfile .);
stop

legend right
| Workflow | Trigger | Color |
| ci | push to main / pull_request | #palegreen |
| ai-ios | ai/ios paths | #lightblue |
| ai-image | ai/server and Gradle paths | #wheat |
endlegend
@enduml
